  alt admin confirms
    ADM->>P: 10 confirmFinalList(workshop_id)
    P->>VC: 11 finalizeAttendance(workshop_id, admin_id)
    VC->>AD: 12 getAdmin(admin_id)
    VC->>A: 13 finalizeRecords(workshop_id, admin_id, is_verified=true)
    VC->>R: 14 updateParticipationHistory(registration_ids, status)
    VC-->>P: 15 showFinalizationResult(status)
  else admin cancels
    ADM->>P: 16 cancelFinalization(workshop_id)
  end
```

